WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:01.767
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:02.767
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:03.567
We hope you're
doing well tonight

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:04.434
and now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:05.467
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:07.234
The Manhattan grand jury
investigating

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:09.968
former President Trump's
alleged involvement

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.300
in a hush money payment

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.033
is reportedly not expected
to hear any more evidence

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:15.100
for the next month.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.367
Oh, you mean they need
some time off

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:19.934
after hearing nothing
but Trump sex stories?

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:21.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.968
"Please, we just we just --

00:00:22.968 --> 00:00:24.601
we just need a month!"

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:26.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:28.868
According to a new report,
several top Republican donors

00:00:28.868 --> 00:00:30.901
are worried that Florida
Governor Ron DeSantis

00:00:30.901 --> 00:00:33.534
does not have the charisma
for a national campaign.

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:35.868
This guy? This guy
doesn't have the charisma

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.601
for a local ad campaign.

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:39.968
[ Laughter ]
He looks like a used car dealer

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:42.734
who insists on being
in the commercials.

00:00:42.734 --> 00:00:44.501
[ As DeSantis ]
Come on down to Ron's motors.

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:46.901
Our prices aren't woke

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:48.400
and that's no joke!

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.934 --> 00:00:52.367
Republican Congressman
Mike Gallagher warned this week

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:55.033
that China wants to use
artificial intelligence

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:57.934
to perfect its
"Orwellian surveillance state."

00:00:57.934 --> 00:01:00.601
Unfortunately, Republicans
don't know what that means

00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:02.334
because they banned that book.

00:01:02.334 --> 00:01:04.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:07.267
Dr. Anthony Fauci has reportedly
sold his memoir

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:09.067
for just under $5 million.

00:01:09.067 --> 00:01:10.934
He will not narrate
the audiobook, though,

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:13.400
because he knows no one
ever listens to him.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.567
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:01:15.567 --> 00:01:17.434
Two fishermen
who allegedly cheated

00:01:17.434 --> 00:01:19.767
in a competitive
fishing competition in Ohio

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:21.868
pleaded guilty this week
to criminal charges

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:23.801
and face up to one year
in prison.

00:01:23.801 --> 00:01:25.634
And do you know what they do
to people

00:01:25.634 --> 00:01:28.000
who cheat at fishing, in prison?

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.033
Because I don't.

00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:30.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.501 --> 00:01:33.200
I'm guessing it's literally
never happened before.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.868 --> 00:01:36.400
A travel company has announced
it will offer

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:38.501
the world's longest bus journey
this summer,

00:01:38.501 --> 00:01:41.434
which will take riders
on a 56-day trip across Europe

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.467
or, for a cheaper 56-day trip,

00:01:43.467 --> 00:01:45.234
book a Greyhound
to Jacksonville.

00:01:45.234 --> 00:01:48.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:53.701
I feel like one of our writers,
Bryan, did that once

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:56.067
and thought maybe
the whole audience had as well.

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:59.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.901
It was announced yesterday
that the sequel

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:02.734
to author John Grisham's book
"The Firm"

00:02:02.734 --> 00:02:04.067
will be released later
this year.

00:02:04.067 --> 00:02:05.567
This news first reported

00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:07.868
in an all-caps text
from your dad.

00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:10.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.901 --> 00:02:12.601
Today was baseball's
Opening Day,

00:02:12.601 --> 00:02:14.901
with all 30 MLB teams
playing games,

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:16.634
and it's about 40° here
in New York,

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:18.801
so, if you're the Mets,
this is what it feels like

00:02:18.801 --> 00:02:19.868
to play in October.

00:02:19.868 --> 00:02:22.701
[ Laughter and awws ]

00:02:24.534 --> 00:02:26.634
And, finally, the department
store chain Macy's

00:02:26.634 --> 00:02:29.701
announced yesterday that its CEO
will retire next year,

00:02:29.701 --> 00:02:31.801
while T.J.Maxx announced
their CEO

00:02:31.801 --> 00:02:33.567
is just a loose pile of pants.

00:02:33.567 --> 00:02:35.000
[ Laughter ]
-And that --

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.200
that was a monologue, everybody.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.634
[ Cheering and applause ]
We're off and running.

